WEBVTT


00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:01.000
I entered this question,

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.320
I said,

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:02.240
Caraca Brother,

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:03.520
I know I need to work,

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:04.240
but before,

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:05.200
when I had the store,

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:06.480
the more money I had,

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.480
but I worked.

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:08.200
And now,

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.440
the less money I had,

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:10.560
but I worked.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:13.120
Will we only live for the money?

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.036
I put a sentence in my life that is like, 

00:00:15.036 --> 00:00:15.200
bro,

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.000
money cannot come in if joy has to come out.

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:20.880
And that's this good stop,

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:22.847
this stop I said, 

00:00:22.847 --> 00:00:23.240
bro,

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.480
that's what I want for my life,

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:25.720
no matter what I'm doing,

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:26.920
have to work with joy,

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:27.840
with happiness.

